ect with my heart then  I'll head to the kitchen and drink this  entire bottle to keep myself hydrated  I'll put the kettle on and make myself a  pot of green tea I tend to sleep through  the entire pot of green tea while going  on my laptop to read your comments and  reply to as many as I can while  depending on my schedule I don't get to  do this every morning although I really  wish I could reply to all of you  personally this is also when I'll write  down my things to accomplish for the day  it helps to keep me focused and  organized then I'll head to the kitchen  again and have my breakfast or  pre-workout meal so I like to keep it  rather light nowadays I've been hooked  on oats especially my favourite sloppy  overnight oatmeal so I made this bowl  the night before and it is really  convenient especially on my busy  mornings I've mixed it with half a cup  of milk 1 tablespoon of goji berries and  1 TSP of chair seeds topped with mango  cubes yummy time to get change into my  workout clothes and hit the gym my  activewear is by my own clothing line  fit and feminine do check it out and you  can shop my food collection in the link  below I tend to do my workouts in my  dream apartment for about 45 to 60  minutes depending on my routine for the  day so today it's total body circuit  training 6 exercises 5 sets in 30  minutes so it is a short and intense and  I like to wear my polyhedron monitor to  keep track of my training progress after  the really sweaty session I'll head back  and take a shower on a normal day  I'm usually dressed in my jean skirt and  casual top after my shower and while  waiting for my hair  drei because I do not like to use the  hairdryer too often that's when I'll  make my post-workout snack green  smoothie so one cup of frozen banana  sliced one cup of green leafy vegetable  half a cup of milk half a cup of water  and 1 tablespoon of goji berries blend  it up cheers guys okay time for my  skincare routine so at the moment I'm  using two 